# Always applied by `vite build` (production mode), on top of the git-ignored
# .env — regardless of whether that file's own VITE_API_URL line happens to be
# commented out or pointed at a stale host on whichever machine runs the build.
#
# www.miltafs.com is a static Apache host with no backend of its own: every
# `/api/*` call the frontend makes has to go to an absolute URL, or it 404s
# there (confirmed directly — Apache's own 404 page, not the Node app's).
# .env's own VITE_API_URL is a LOCAL DEV convenience only (see its comment —
# it routes around one developer's network filtering a request their local
# Express server would otherwise proxy just fine), never something a real
# deploy should depend on being set correctly by hand.
VITE_API_URL=https://phase3-milta.onrender.com/api
